    "description": "Now unlocated, Ad Matrem Magnam was station included on the Antonine Itinerary and located on the Via Herculia between Equus Tuticus and Venusia. Possibly to be identified with Grottaminarda, where traces of a cult of the Great Mother are attested.",
    "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: between Aequum Tuticum and Venusia.</p>",
